  "story": {
    "eyebrow": "01 — The story",
    "quote": "I write songs the way a radio plays in another room: *half-heard*, then *suddenly everything.* Most of them start on the last tram home, when the city is still humming but nobody is listening. This record is a collection of *those rides.*",
